msgstr "Kuva minipildid"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3855
msgid ""
"Display thumbnail images at the bottom of the gallery for easy navigation. "
"This is available for slideshows and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Kuva minipildi pildid galerii allosas, et hõlbustada navigeerimist. See on "
"saadaval slaidide ja pildigaleriide jaoks."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3868
msgid "How visitors open images"
msgstr "Kuidas külastajad avavad pilte"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3889
msgid "Show captions"
msgstr "Kuva pealdised"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3890
msgid ""
"When enabled, display captions in the gallery window. This is available for "
"slideshows, images, and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Kui lubatud, kuvatakse pealdised galerii aknas. See on saadaval slaidide, "
"piltide ja pildigaleriide jaoks."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3897
msgid "Advanced lightbox features are available through MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr ""
"Kasutusele on saadaval arenenud lightboxi funktsioonid MetaSlider Gallery "
"Pro kaudu."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3899
msgid "Get a preview of the advanced features available in MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr ""
"Saage eelvaade arenenud funktsioonidest, mis on saadaval MetaSlider Gallery "
"Pro-s."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3902
msgid ""
"These advanced LightGallery.js plugins are available in the Pro version "
"with additional customization options."
msgstr ""
"Need arenenud LightGallery.js pistikprogrammid on saadaval Pro versioonis "
"koos täiendavate kohandamisvõimalustega."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3930 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3931
msgid "specific Pages"
msgstr "spetsiifilised lehed"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3933
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Valige lehed, kus galerii tuleks keelata. Kuvatakse kuni 100 kõige "
"hiljutisemat lehte. Otsimiseks tippige."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3933 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3934
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Valige lehed, kus galerii tuleks lubada. Kuvatakse kuni 100 kõige "
"hiljutisemat lehte. Otsimiseks tippige."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3978 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3979
msgid "specific Posts"
msgstr "spetsiifilised postitused"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3981
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Valige postitused, kus galerii tuleks keelata. Näitab kuni 100 kõige uuemat "
"postitust. Tüüp otsimiseks."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3981 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3982
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Valige postitused, kus galerii tuleks lubada. Näitab kuni 100 kõige uuemat "
"postitust. Tüüp otsimiseks."

